BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 60 750 Td (Demo Flow Reactor Operating Notes - synthetic document for the LAB GENE demonstration) Tj T* (Page 1) Tj T* () Tj T* (1. Scope) Tj T* (These notes describe how to run palladium-catalysed Suzuki-Miyaura coupling in the droplet) Tj T* (flow reactor. They are a synthetic document written for a demonstration and are not a vendor) Tj T* (manual.) Tj T* () Tj T* (2. Operating limits) Tj T* (The flow reactor temperature must stay between 30 and 110 °C.) Tj T* (The residence time in the flow reactor must stay between 60 and 600 s.) Tj T* (Catalyst loading must stay between 0.5 and 2.5 mol% to protect the downstream filter.) Tj T* (System pressure must not exceed 17 bar during start-up.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
