stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 60 750 Td (Demo Flow Reactor Operating Notes - synthetic document for the LAB GENE demonstration) Tj T* (Page 2) Tj T* () Tj T* (3. Chemistry notes) Tj T* (Suzuki-Miyaura coupling requires a base such as DBU.) Tj T* (Higher temperature promotes protodeboronation of heteroaryl boronic acids.) Tj T* (Protodeboronation decreases reaction yield because the boronic acid is consumed before) Tj T* (transmetallation.) Tj T* (Longer residence time increases conversion until the catalyst deactivates.) Tj T* (Carbon-carbon homocoupling reaction competes with Suzuki-Miyaura coupling when oxygen enters) Tj T* (the feed.) Tj T* () Tj T* (4. Recommended window) Tj T* (For heteroaryl boronic acid pinacol esters the recommended temperature is 60 to 100 °C.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
