BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 60 750 Td (Demo Flow Reactor Operating Notes - synthetic document for the LAB GENE demonstration) Tj T* (Page 3) Tj T* () Tj T* (5. Precatalysts) Tj T* (XPhos Pd G3 dissolves quickly in THF and gives the most reproducible activation in this) Tj T* (reactor.) Tj T* (SPhos Pd G3 is a good first choice for heteroaryl bromides.) Tj T* (XPhos Pd G3 and SPhos Pd G3 should be stored under nitrogen and weighed fresh for each) Tj T* (campaign.) Tj T* (Mesylate precatalysts tolerate water better than chloride precatalysts.) Tj T* () Tj T* (6. Solvent) Tj T* (THF/water 5:1 is the standard solvent mixture. Degas the water before use.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
