BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 60 750 Td (Demo Flow Reactor Operating Notes - synthetic document for the LAB GENE demonstration) Tj T* (Page 4) Tj T* () Tj T* (7. Maintenance) Tj T* (Flush the reactor with clean THF after every campaign and inspect the droplet generator) Tj T* (weekly.) Tj T* (Replace the inlet filter when the pressure drop rises above the value recorded at) Tj T* (installation.) Tj T* (Record every deviation in the lab notebook so that the knowledge graph can learn from it.) Tj T* ET
